Weng NV-array data
------------------
Creator: Hao-Cheng Weng, University of Bristol.
Source: Data/code availability for "Photonic-integrated quantum sensor array
for microscale magnetic localisation", arXiv:2511.11496, version 1.
DOI: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19855773
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
Licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Four NumPy arrays in study_l/sources/l1_selective/ are extracted, byte-identical
members of the source release. Their filenames have local identifier prefixes;
results/study_l_l1_selective_inventory.csv records the original archive members
and checksums. The source archive is not bundled in full. Acquisition metadata
and log-transformed features are derived by the included data loaders. Result
tables and predictions were generated for this study; they are not the source
authors' published model outputs.

